#==============================================================================================
#
#   geometry_chop - chopping quads and cubics at their extrema
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of tiny-skia path_geometry.rs (chop_quad_at_x/y_extrema,
#       chop_cubic_at_x/y_extrema, chop_cubic_at_max_curvature), with chop_cubic_at taken
#       from Skia m144 src/core/SkGeometry.cpp (SkChopCubicAt with several t values, which
#       splits two at a time). Chopping a monotonic cubic at a clip line is in cubics.lucb.
#
